E             # shell process reached the beginning of a sweep.
E             write_watchdog_heartbeat
E             # P2: heartbeat + an early snapshot write BEFORE the heavy/stall-prone work
E             # (git sync, pip refresh). If anything below hangs, the cache is at most
E             # ~one sweep stale instead of frozen indefinitely. The early write uses last
E             # sweep's report and is "notrack" (best-effort, not counted toward
E             # escalation); the authoritative write at sweep end still counts. The
